# fable5-astra-judged — the cross-family-judging harness (same as /fusion-astra).
#
# Same cross-model panel as fable5-astra (Fable 5.1 + GPT-6 Astra), but GPT-6 Astra (codex) does the discernment
# instead of a blind Fable subprocess — the adjudicator is a different model family than the synthesizer.
# Requires the codex CLI; run_judge.sh falls back to the Fable judge per SKILL.md if it's missing.
: "${FUSION_PANEL:=fable5,astra}"
: "${FUSION_JUDGE:=astra}"
: "${FUSION_CLAUDE_MODEL:=claude-fable-5-1}"
: "${FUSION_OPUS_MODEL:=opus}"
: "${CODEX_PANELIST_MODEL:=gpt-6-astra}"
: "${JUDGE_MODEL:=gpt-6-astra}"
